    "description": {
      "value": "<p>As a Bonus Action, you can expend one Superiority Die and take the Dash action. If you move at least 5 feet in a straight line immediately before hitting with a melee attack as part of the Attack action on this turn, you can add the Superiority Die to the attack's damage roll.</p><section id=\"secret-khNyinLybLxVPkDd\" class=\"secret\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>The <strong>Damage</strong> activity allows you to select the type of damage it should deal in the roll dialog.</p></section>",
